      "type": "grammar",
      "title": "正在 + verb: action in progress",
      "body": "To say someone is doing something right now, put 正在 before the verb. It works like English 'am/is/are ...ing'. The verb itself never changes form. You can ask 'What are you doing?' with 你正在做什么？",
      "examples": [
        {
          "zh": "我正在吃饭。",
          "en": "I'm eating."
        },
